sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Writer A
    participant S as Shadow service
    participant B as Writer B
    A->>S: GET
    S-->>A: version=N
    B->>S: UPDATE with version=N
    S-->>B: Accepted, version=N+1
    A->>S: UPDATE with version=N
    S-->>A: 409 Version conflict
    A->>S: GET latest state
    S-->>A: Current state and version
    A->>A: Reconcile intended change
    opt Change is still valid and safe to retry
        A->>S: UPDATE reconciled patch with current version
        S-->>A: Accepted or new conflict
    end
